TRV optical vendor directory
============================

Drop offline QR **decoder** sources here. No CDN at runtime.

Primary recommended (MIT OR Apache-2.0):
  https://github.com/paulmillr/qr
  Smaller, faster, actively maintained, 0-dep.
  Place a browser-usable build so that global `decodeQR` is available.

  License: MIT OR Apache-2.0 (dual)
  Copyright (c) 2023 Paul Miller and contributors
  (contains code inspired by ZXing, Apache-2.0)

Legacy / not preferred:
  https://github.com/cozmo/jsQR  (Apache-2.0) — unmaintained

Do NOT vendor Meta / Google / Microsoft proprietary SDKs.

Receiver load order:
  1. BarcodeDetector (Chromium) when present
  2. global decodeQR (paulmillr/qr) from this folder if loaded
  3. Paste / file import of TRVL1 lines always works
